SUMMARY:Colin Mochrie & Asad Mecci: HYPROV Improv Under Hypnosis LIVE at OL
	G Stage at Fallsview Casino (Night 2)
DTSTAMP:20260823T033703Z
DTSTART:20260823T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nColin Mochrie & Asad Mecci: HYPROV Improv Under
	 Hypnosis LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino (Night 2)\nDon’t miss the 
	second night of HYPROV: Improv Under Hypnosis as Colin Mochrie and master 
	hypnotist Asad Mecci return to the OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino in Niagar
	a Falls\, Ontario on Sunday\, August 23\, 2026. This groundbreaking show c
	ombines the art of hypnosis with live improv comedy for a truly one-of-a-k
	ind experience. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026\nTime: 3:
	00 PM (Doors open 1 hour prior)\nVenue: OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nAdd
	ress: 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\, ON L2G 0Z1\, Canada\nAge Requirem
	ent: All ages welcome (children 12 and under must be accompanied by an adu
	lt)\nParking: Available across the street at Fallsview Casino Resort \nAbo
	ut Colin Mochrie & Asad Mecci\nColin Mochrie is best known as a beloved ca
	st member of the hit improv comedy show Whose Line Is It Anyway?\, where h
	is quick wit and fearless improvisation made him a household name. Asad Me
	cci is a world-renowned master hypnotist who has performed for audiences a
	cross the globe. Together\, they created HYPROV — a revolutionary live sho
	w that blends the unpredictability of improv comedy with the astonishing p
	ower of hypnosis. \nWhat to Expect\n\nAudience volunteers are hypnotized o
	n stage and become the stars of the show\nColin Mochrie improvises hilario
	us scenes with the hypnotized participants\nEvery performance is completel
	y unique — no two shows are ever the same\nA perfect blend of comedy\, won
	der\, and audience participation\nSuitable for all ages (children 12 and u
	nder must be with an adult)\nPhone-free experience — Yondr pouches will be
	 used during the performance\n\nVenue Information\nOLG Stage at Fallsview 
	Casino is one of Niagara Falls’ premier entertainment venues\, located at 
	6366 Stanley Ave inside the iconic Fallsview Casino Resort. With a capacit
	y of 5\,000\, it offers excellent sightlines and world-class amenities. Th
	e venue is accessible via the Galleria walkway in Fallsview Casino Resort 
	or from Murray St./Stanley Ave at street level. \nTicket Information\nTick
	ets start at $54 and are available now through Ticketmaster. Resale ticket
	s are also available through VividSeats. There is an 8-ticket limit per or
	der. Accessible seating is available — contact the venue for details. \n\n
	Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We
	 earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra c
	ost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid pho
	to ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/colin
	-mochrie-asad-mecci-hyprov-improv-under-hypnosis-live-at-olg-stage-fallsvi
	ew-casino-night-two/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/colin-mochrie-asad-mecci-hyprov-improv
	-under-hypnosis-live-at-olg-stage-fallsview-casino-night-two/
LOCATION:OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\, 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\,
	 ON\, L2G 3Y5\, Canada
