DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nApril Macie LIVE at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nSt
	and-up comedian April Macie headlines Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club inside MG
	M Grand in Las Vegas on August 25\, 2026. Known for her fearless\, no-hold
	s-barred comedy style\, April brings her unique brand of humor to the Stri
	p for a night of unforgettable laughs alongside Brad Garrett. \nEvent Deta
	ils\nDate: Tuesday\, August 25\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Brad Garre
	tt’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3799 Las Vegas Blvd South\, Las Vegas\, NV 8910
	9 (inside MGM Grand)\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nParking: M
	GM Grand parking available \nAbout April Macie\nApril Macie is a stand-up 
	comedian best known for her appearance on NBC’s Last Comic Standing\, wher
	e she became a fan favorite with her bold\, edgy humor. She has performed 
	at comedy clubs and festivals across the country and has built a devoted f
	ollowing for her fearless\, no-filter approach to stand-up comedy. April’s
	 material draws from real life with sharp wit and infectious energy. \nWha
	t to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand-up set by April Macie\nSpecial appearance 
	by Brad Garrett\nIntimate showroom setting inside MGM Grand\nBold\, fearle
	ss\, no-filter comedy\n18+ show with adult humor\nBest available seating w
	ithin purchased zone\n\nVenue Information\nBrad Garrett’s Comedy Club is l
	ocated inside the MGM Grand Hotel & Casino on the Las Vegas Strip\, offeri
	ng a premium comedy experience in an intimate setting with excellent sight
	lines and a lively atmosphere. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $8
	6. Seating is best available within the zone purchased — seats are not ass
	igned until arrival. There is an overall 8-ticket limit per order. All per
	formers subject to change without notice. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Ticke
	ts \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purch
	ase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are fin
	al. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry
	.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/april-macie-live-at-brad-garretts-co
	medy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/april-macie-live-at-brad-garretts-come
	dy-club/
LOCATION:Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\, 3799 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, N
	V\, 89109\, USA
