SUMMARY:Roy Wood Jr. LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii
DTSTAMP:20260823T033703Z
DTSTART:20260827T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nRoy Wood Jr. is one of the most respected and versatile comedians wor
	king today. Best known as a longtime correspondent on The Daily Show with 
	Trevor Noah\, Roy has earned Emmy nominations for his work and has establi
	shed himself as a sharp\, insightful voice in both stand-up comedy and pol
	itical satire. \nRoy’s stand-up comedy is rooted in his Southern upbringin
	g\, his observations on race and culture in America\, and his ability to f
	ind humor in the most unexpected places. His specials\, including Father F
	igure and Impersonating Myself\, have been critically acclaimed and showca
	se his remarkable range as a storyteller and comedian. \nBeyond The Daily 
	Show\, Roy has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Conan\, Late Night with Seth
	 Meyers\, and numerous other television programs. He is also an Emmy-nomin
	ated documentary producer\, adding another dimension to his already impres
	sive creative portfolio. \nEvent Details\nDates: Thursday\, August 27\, 20
	26 & Friday\, August 28\, 2026 \nShow Times: Aug 27 at 6:30 PM & 8:30 PM H
	ST | Aug 28 at 6:30 PM HST \nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Ave\,
	 Honolulu\, HI 96815 \nClub Policy: $20 food or beverage minimum per perso
	n. Seating is first come\, first served. Full bar and full dinner menu ava
	ilable. \nAbout the Venue\nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s most celebrated 
	intimate live entertainment venue\, nestled inside the Outrigger Waikiki B
	each Resort at 2335 Kalakaua Avenue in the heart of Waikiki. The venue is 
	renowned for its world-class acoustics\, intimate atmosphere\, and excepti
	onal dining and bar service. \nWith seating options ranging from Premium S
	eating to Loge Seating & Bar Area\, every guest enjoys an up-close experie
	nce with the performer. The venue’s warm\, sophisticated ambiance makes it
	 the perfect setting for a special night out in Waikiki. \nBlue Note Hawai
	i is located steps from Waikiki Beach\, making it easy to combine a comedy
	 show with a beautiful Hawaiian evening. Parking is available at the Outri
	gger Waikiki Beach Resort and nearby public parking structures. \nWhat to 
	Expect\nRoy Wood Jr.’s shows at Blue Note Hawaii will be an intimate\, tho
	ught-provoking comedy experience. Having performed on some of the biggest 
	stages in comedy\, Roy brings his full headline set to the intimate Blue N
	ote Hawaii stage for a rare up-close experience. \nExpect sharp political 
	and social commentary delivered with Roy’s signature warmth and Southern c
	harm. His shows are known for their intelligence\, accessibility\, and abi
	lity to make audiences laugh while also making them think about the world 
	around them. \nThree shows are available across two nights\, giving fans m
	ultiple opportunities to catch this Emmy-nominated comedian. Tickets are e
	xpected to sell out quickly given Roy’s national profile and the intimate 
	capacity of Blue Note Hawaii. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $91 
	(resale market) \nSecure your seats now through the official ticket link o
	r find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
	\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/roy-wood-jr-live-at-blue-note-hawaii/
	\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/roy-wood-jr-live-at-blue-note-hawaii/
